From: CodeOS Team <codeos@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add CodeOS sysfs nodes for system telemetry

Adds /sys/codeos/version and /sys/codeos/pulse_status for userspace
service discovery during early boot.

---
 drivers/codeos/sysfs.c | 42 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 42 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/codeos/sysfs.c b/drivers/codeos/sysfs.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..abc1234
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/codeos/sysfs.c
@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@
+// CodeOS kernel sysfs nodes — stub patch for v0.1
+// Full implementation planned for v0.2
+
+#define CODEOS_VERSION "0.1.0-alpha"
+
+// Exposes:
+//   /sys/codeos/version      — kernel+CodeOS version string
+//   /sys/codeos/pulse_status — PulseLink readiness flag
